ld shadow-md hover:shadow-lg\">مشاوره رایگان</button></div><button class=\"lg:hidden p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors duration-200\" aria-label=\"منوی موبایل\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6 text-text-700\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 mb-4\">طراحی تجربه کاربری پیشرفته</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">معماری اطلاعات و <span class=\"gradient-text\">تجربه کاربری UX</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">راز ماندگاری کاربران و موفقیت دیجیتال! طراحی UX علمی با روانشناسی کاربران و معماری اطلاعات هوشمند برای نرخ تبدیل ۲۵۰% افزایش در عصر سئو.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md px-8 gradient-bg text-white\">شروع طراحی UX</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-11 rounded-md px-8\">نمونه کارها UX</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-indigo-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2\">۲۵۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900\">افزایش نرخ تبدیل</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">۷۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900\">کاهش نرخ خروج</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">۶۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900\">سرعت یافت اطلاعات</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-pink-600 mb-2\">۱۸۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900\">افزایش رضایت</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">سه اصل پایه <span class=\"gradient-text\">طراحی UX موفق</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">رویکرد علمی عصر سئو برای تجربه کاربری بی‌نظیر</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">معماری اطلاعات ساخت‌یافته</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">تنظیم ساختار استاندارد سایت برای یافتن سریع اطلاعات توسط کاربران و گوگل با سلسله مراتب منطقی و ناوبری روان.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>یافت سریع اطلاعات</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>بهبود تجربه کاربر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>رتبه‌بندی بهتر گوگل</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">سفر کاربر بهینه‌شده</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">طراحی مسیرهای دسترسی و تعامل به گونه‌ای که کاربر بدون سردرگمی و با کمترین کلیک به هدف خود برسد.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>افزایش نرخ تبدیل</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>کاهش نرخ خروج</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>رضایت بالاتر کاربر</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">رعایت الگوهای برتر جهان</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">استفاده از بهترین شیوه‌ها و پترن‌های UX جهانی که توسط میلیون‌ها کاربر تست شده‌اند.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>تجربه شناخته شده</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>قابل پیش‌بینی بودن</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>کارایی بالا</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-indigo-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">رویکردهای <span class=\"gradient-text\">UX پیشرفته</span> عصر سئو</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">метод‌هایی که توسط برندهای جهانی اثبات شده‌اند</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground p-6 border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">Design Thinking Process</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3\">فرآیند اجرایی:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Empathize - فهم نیاز کاربران</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Define - تعریف مسئله</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Ideate - تولید ایده</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Prototype - ایجاد نمونه</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Test - آزمایش و بهبود</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-lg\">+۳۲۰% بهبود تجربه کاربری</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground p-6 border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">User Journey Mapping</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3\">فرآیند اجرایی:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>نقشه‌ریزی مسیر کاربر</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>شناسایی نقاط تماس</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>تحلیل نقاط درد</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>طراحی راه حل‌ها</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>بهینه‌سازی مداوم</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-lg\">+۲۸۰% افزایش نرخ ماندگاری</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground p-6 border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">Usability Testing Framework</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3\">فرآیند اجرایی:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>تایین سناریوهای تست</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>اجرای تست با کاربران واقعی</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>تحلیل رفتار کاربران</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>شناسایی مشکلات</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>تکرار و بهبود</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-lg\">+۴۵۰% بهبود نرخ تکمیل هدف</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">تکنیک‌های UX <span class=\"gradient-text\">اثبات‌شده</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600\">روش‌هایی که نرخ تبدیل را به طور چشمگیری بهبود می‌دهند</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">F-Pattern &amp; Z-Pattern Layout</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">طراحی چیدمان صفحات بر اساس الگوی طبیعی خواندن کاربران</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700\">۵۰% بهبود جذب اولیه</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Progressive Disclosure</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">نمایش اطلاعات به تدریج برای جلوگیری از overwhelming شدن کاربر</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700\">۶۰% کاهش نرخ خروج</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Visual Hierarchy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">مرتب‌سازی عناصر بصری بر اساس اهمیت نسبی آنها</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700\">۸۰% بهبود فهم محتوا</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Affordance Design</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">طراحی عناصر که عملکرد خود را نشان دهند</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-100 text-green-700\">۹۰% کاهش سردرگمی کاربر</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">روش‌های تحقیق <span class=\"gradient-text\">کاربر محور</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600\">کشف نیازهای واقعی کاربران با رویکرد علمی</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">User Interviews</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">مصاحبه عمیق با کاربران هدف برای فهم نیازهای واقعی</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">دریافت بینش‌های جامع</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Usability Testing</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">تست کاربردپذیری با کاربران واقعی در شرایط واقعی</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">شناسایی مشکلات واقعی</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">A/B Testing</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">تست دو یا چند نسخه متفاوت برای یافتن بهترین رویکرد</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">تصمیم‌گیری مبتنی بر داده</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Heatmap Analysis</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">تحلیل نقشه حرارتی کلیک‌ها و اسکرول صفحات</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">درک رفتار کاربر</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">محصولات تحویلی <span class=\"gradient-text\">UX Design</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">ارزش واقعی را در تحویل نهایی دریافت کنید</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">User Personas - پروفایل کاربران هدف</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">User Journey Maps - نقشه سفر کاربر</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">Information Architecture Diagrams - نمودار معماری اطلاعات</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">Wireframes &amp; Prototypes - نمونه‌های اولیه و تعاملی</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">Usability Reports - گزارش‌های کاربردپذیری</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm\">A/B Testing Results - نتایج تست A/B</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-indigo-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">مزایای طراحی <span class=\"gradient-text\">UX حرفه‌ای</span> عصر سئو</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">آمارهای واقعی از بهبود پروژه‌های UX طراحی شده</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">۲۵۰% افزایش نرخ تبدیل با سفر کاربر بهینه‌سازی شده</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">۷۰% کاهش نرخ خروج سایت با تجربه کاربری روان</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">۶۰% بهبود زمان یافت اطلاعات با معماری اطلاعات استاندارد</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">۱۸۰% افزایش رضایت کاربران با‌الگوهای UX جهانی</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">فرآیند <span class=\"gradient-text\">طراحی UX</span> عصر سئو</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600\">رویکرد ۶ مرحله‌ای برای UX Design کاملاً اثربخش</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">تحقیق و تحلیل</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">مصاحبه با کاربران، تحلیل رقبا، بررسی اهداف کسب‌وکار</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۱-۲ هفته</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">طراحی استراتژی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">تعریف معماری اطلاعات، نقشه سفر کاربر، اهداف کمی</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۳-۵ روز</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">نمونه‌سازی اولیه</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">Wireframe، Prototype تعاملی، طرح‌های اولیه</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۱ هفته</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">تست و بررسی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">Usability testing، A/B Testing، جمع‌آوری بازخورد</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۵-۷ روز</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">5</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">نهایی‌سازی و تحویل</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">اجرای نهایی، مستندسازی، آموزش تیم توسعه</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۳-۵ روز</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">6</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">پشتیبانی پس از تحویل</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">پیگیری عملکرد، پیشنهادات بهبود، تا ۳ ماه</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">مدت زمان: <!-- -->۲-۳ ماه</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">سوالات <span class=\"gradient-text\">متداول</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">پاسخ به پرسش‌های مشتریان درباره طراحی UX و تجربه کاربری</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>تجربه کاربری (UX) دقیقاً چیست و چه تفاوتی با UI دارد؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">UX یا تجربه کاربری کل تجربه کاربر از محصول یا سرویس شماست - از راه‌اندازی اولیه تا استفاده روزمره. UI یا رابط کاربری صرفاً ظاهر گرافیکی است. UX شامل تحقیق کاربران، معماری اطلاعات، قابلیت استفاده و رضایت کلی است.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>چقدر زمان برای طراحی UX یک وب‌سایت نیاز است؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بسته به پیچیدگی پروژه، معمولاً بین ۲ تا ۶ هفته زمان نیاز است. پروژه‌های ساده‌ ۲ هفته، فروشگاه‌های آنلاین ۴ هفته و پلتفرم‌های پیچیده ۶ هفته یا بیشتر زمان نیاز دارند.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا پروژه UX شامل تحقیقات کاربر هم می‌شود؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بله! قوی‌ترین بخش سرویس ما انجام تحقیقات عمیق است. ما از روش‌های User Interviews، Usability Testing، A/B Testing و تحلیل داده‌ها برای طراحی UX استفاده می‌کنیم و به این تحقیقات تکیه می‌کنیم.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>پس از طراحی UX، چه تحویلاتی دریافت می‌کنم؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">User Personas، User Journey Maps، Wireframes، Interactive Prototypes، Usability Test Reports، و مستندات کامل UX Guidelines که تیم توسعه شما برای پیاده‌سازی دقیقاً نیاز دارد.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا می‌توان UX را برای اپلیکیشن موبایل هم طراحی کرد؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بله! علاوه بر وب‌سایت‌ها، ما خدمات UX Design برای اپلیکیشن‌های موبایل و وب‌اپلیکیشن‌ها هم ارائه می‌دهیم. رویکرد Mobile-First Design را در تمام پروژه‌ها رعایت می‌کنیم.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>چطور می‌توانم کیفیت کار UX Design را ارزیابی کنم؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">کیفیت کار UX را می‌توان از طریق Usability Testing، A/B Testing و تحلیل نرخ تبدیل اندازه‌گیری کرد. ما این تحلیل‌ها را به همراه مستندات تحویل می‌دهیم.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">تجربه کاربری برتر، فروش بی‌رقیب!</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto opacity-90\">با طراحی UX علمی عصر سئو، تبدیل کاربران به مشتریان وفادار. تجربه‌ای که فراموش‌نشدنی است و فروش شما را چندین برابر می‌کند. پروژه UX خود را همین امروز شروع کنید!</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 rounded-md px-8 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white\">مشاوره طراحی UX رایگان</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border bg-background h-11 rounded-md px-8 border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-slate-900\">مشاهده نمونه کارهای UX</button></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 space-x-reverse\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-asre-blue-500 to-asre-green-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg\">ع</span></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">عصر سئو</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">AsreSEO</p></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">ما در عصر سئو با ارائه خدمات حرفه‌ای دیجیتال مارکتینگ، کسب‌وکار شما را به قله موفقیت می‌رسانیم. تیم متخصص ما آماده همراهی شماست.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 space-x-reverse\"><a href=\"mailto:info@asreseo.com\" class=\"flex items-center text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-5 w-5 ml-2\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>info@asreseo.com</a></div></div><div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">خدمات ما</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/services/seo\">سئو و بهینه‌سازی</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/services/google-ads\">تبلیغات گوگل</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/services/digital-marketing\">دیجیتال مارکتینگ</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/services/web-design\">طراحی وب‌سایت</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=